@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title ContextFilter — Infrastructure data flow

component "Application ports" as APP
component "Infrastructure adapters" as INF
component "Migration" as MIG
component "Sanitize / Validate" as SAN
folder "%AppData%\\ContextFilter" as DATA {
  file "settings.json" as SETTINGS
  file "presets.json" as PRESETS
  file "recent.json" as RECENT
  folder "logs" as LOGS
}

APP --> INF : save / load
INF --> SETTINGS
INF --> PRESETS
INF --> RECENT
INF --> LOGS

SETTINGS --> MIG
PRESETS --> MIG
MIG --> SAN
SAN --> INF : supported runtime representation

note right of SETTINGS
Persisted data is input,
not trusted runtime truth.
end note

note bottom of PRESETS
JsonPresetStore uses
atomic write mechanics.
end note

@enduml
